error[E0495]: invalid left operand of '??'
  --> $DIR/coalesce-precedence.nra:12:62
   |
12 | let pick = func(ready: bool, done: bool, x: bool) -> bool => ready || done ?? x;
   |                                                              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ bool is not a reference or an Optional
   |
   = note: '??' gives its right operand when the left one is nil or None

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0495`.
